    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 05 · Retro Synthesizer\n**Two forms.** The team fills in the **anonymous** feedback form (no name, no email). When ready, the PM opens the **Synthesize** form and picks the retro.\n\n**Anonymity rule:** no synthesis below the minimum number of responses (Settings → minResponses). The **Retro Analyst** groups feedback into themes with counts and anonymous quotes, flags recurring problems, proposes up to 3 measurable actions and drafts a team summary. Owners are agreed in the retro, not by the AI.\n\n**Guardrails:** no names collected · no quotes that identify anyone · minimum responses · actions logged UNASSIGNED · approval gate · audit log",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 896,
